<title>USA: NYSE UNAVAILABLES - Seagate Technology, Corimon.</title>
<headline>NYSE UNAVAILABLES - Seagate Technology, Corimon.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Tuesday that Seagate Technology Inc was unavailable for after-hours trading due to news.</p>
<p>Also unavailable was Corimon SACA.</p>
</text>
